patients from successfully enrolling and completing clinical trial procedures, including delays in processing or obtaining patient travel visas or denials of
entry at borders, potential travel disruptions, or de-prioritization or unavailability of resources at clinical sites for non-resident international clinical trial
participants, any of which could delay our progress and completion of planned clinical trials and which would have an adverse effect on our business. In
